- `max`: `10-20` per app instance. Lower if many app replicas.
- `connectionTimeoutMillis`: `2000-5000`.
- `idleTimeoutMillis`: `10000-30000`.
- `statement_timeout`: per query, usually `3000-15000`.

Rules:
- Always `release()` client in `finally`.
- Use `pool.query(...)` for simple one-shot queries.
- Use `pool.connect()` only for transactions or session settings.
- Do not retry writes blindly. Retry reads only if idempotent and error transient.
- On shutdown, call `pool.end()` in SIGTERM/SIGINT handler.

